<title>TURKEY: Turkish prosecutors demand Erbakan party closure.</title>
<headline>Turkish prosecutors demand Erbakan party closure.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish prosecutor's office has demanded the closure of Prime Minister Necmettin Erbakan's Islam-based Welfare Party, the state-run Anatolian news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
